From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 16:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SableOS: BlackBerry 7 shade banner opens Manage Connections

Owner decision 2026-11-19. On the BBOS 7 profile (Settings.Secure sable_profile
is bb7) the Sable shade shows a blue banner under the header; tapping it opens
the BlackBerry 7 Manage Connections screen in Settings (patch 1623). BBOS 10 does not
show it and keeps its tiles. The banner is one composable (SableBb7Banner) called
from SableQqsFooter, so it sits inside the QQS height with the Hub summary row.
---
 packages/SystemUI/res/values/sable_bb7_strings.xml                 | 19 +++++
 .../systemui/qs/composefragment/QSFragmentCompose.kt              | 10 +++
 .../systemui/qs/composefragment/ui/SableBb7Banner.kt              | 62 +++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 91 insertions(+)

diff --git a/packages/SystemUI/res/values/sable_bb7_strings.xml b/packages/SystemUI/res/values/sable_bb7_strings.xml
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..3adbb16
--- /dev/null
+++ b/packages/SystemUI/res/values/sable_bb7_strings.xml
@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
+<!--
